Output "out/picker.gif"
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "kit tui --root $KIT_DEMO_ROOT"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Type "/model"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "claude"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "/sessions"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "/effort"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Escape
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
